OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry and cloudy, although a few light
OL,7,Fshowers possible in the east. Clearer
OL,8,Fskies across the west at times with a
OL,9,Fchance of overnight frost.
